{"des":"熔火中的调研-接取步骤","script":"s_5_10_0","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]抱歉打扰你们！你们应该是和瓦菲诺小姐有过合作的契约者吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]噢噢，的确是的……怎么了，你们是瓦菲诺的人吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]是的，是的。我来自修道院的探索队，在大兽潮时曾参加过驿站联军……不不不，现在可不是说这些事情的时候，探索队遇到大麻烦了！[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我们原本只是在外围观察的，但突然一群熔火元素从山径那边冲过来，把我们的队伍全冲散了！[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]他们现在应该还没走远，就在岩壳层附近。那边的熔火元素还没走远，仍然危险重重，可否请几位英雄帮忙，前去搭救一下！[l][cm]","charaName":"研究员斯纳尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]明白了，救人要紧！哈玛塔坎遗迹的岩壳层是吧，我们这就走一趟！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":340,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}